  <item>
    <title>vol.83 活到了金三顺时刻，也掉进了 KPOP 的坑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aed980bb4a4e20202f5c5ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aed980bb4a4e20202f5c5ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近进行了人生第一次的韩国旅行，才意识到过往的自己对于韩国历史以及韩国的流行文化是那么的知识匮乏，无论韩国电影还是韩女文学，我都只看过那些比较热门的作品。与此同时，我也对韩国流行文化中的各种“编辑作为方法”十分好奇，无论电影还是杂志甚至是音乐产业，都可以看到大量“编辑”，甚至他们的店名或是品牌名也都热衷于用编辑的语汇 —— nonfiction、point of view、after chapter、curriculum 等等。</span></p><p><span>在我对于韩国有点好奇又不知道从哪里入手了解时，我找来了小冯，她看过大量韩国电影，常提到金三顺，同时，她这几年也被 KPOP 收编了。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>🎤 一起聊的</span></strong></p><p><span>小冯 aka 爱福（小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/9IvO9R5KBaq" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/9IvO9R5KBaq"><span>@感性司康</span></a><span>），职业 time killer，三心二意的编剧</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>🤼‍♀️ 我们聊了</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> “我们 90 后其实是经历了完整的 KPOP 崛起”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> “我爱上了 NewJeans，爱上了闵熙珍”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 关于闵熙珍作为封面的那一期</span><a href="https://casabrutus.com/magazines/issue/%e3%82%bd%e3%82%a6%e3%83%ab%e3%83%bb%e3%83%a9%e3%82%a4%e3%83%95%e3%82%b9%e3%82%bf%e3%82%a4%e3%83%ab%e3%83%bb%e3%82%ac%e3%82%a4%e3%83%89" data-url="https://casabrutus.com/magazines/issue/%e3%82%bd%e3%82%a6%e3%83%ab%e3%83%bb%e3%83%a9%e3%82%a4%e3%83%95%e3%82%b9%e3%82%bf%e3%82%a4%e3%83%ab%e3%83%bb%e3%82%ac%e3%82%a4%e3%83%89"><span> Casa Brutus 首尔特辑</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> </span><a href="https://bandhyukoh.tumblr.com/post/179885935632/oh-hyuk-for-apartamento-magazine-issue-22" data-url="https://bandhyukoh.tumblr.com/post/179885935632/oh-hyuk-for-apartamento-magazine-issue-22"><span>吴赫的家</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 首尔消费观察 —— 小冯最爱 AMOMENTO</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> “是真的有点羡慕韩国的文化土壤”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> “韩国电影好像距离我们更近一点”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 因为张律的《</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/25710797/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/25710797/"><span>庆州</span></a><span>》去了韩国古城庆州</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 年纪越大越懂得金三顺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 无论韩女文学还是韩国电影，都开始讨论身份问题了</span></p><p></p><p><span>👀 </span><strong><span>这一集提到的电影</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>朴赞郁的《</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/1412579/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/1412579/"><span>亲切的金子</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>洪尚秀的《</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/10796578/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/10796578/"><span>自由之丘</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>金基德的《</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/doulist/157839910/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/doulist/157839910/"><span>春夏秋冬又一春</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>张律的《</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/25710797/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/movie/subject/25710797/"><span>庆州</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>神村浩也的 </span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36189442/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36189442/"><span>《束草的冬天》</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>石井裕也的</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/movie/26847445" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch?uri=/movie/26847445"><span>《夜空总有最大密度的蓝色》</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1477894/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1477894/"><span>我叫金三顺</span></a><span>》《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35460374/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35460374/"><span>酒鬼都市的女人们</span></a><span>》</span></p></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>插播01: 小冯在首尔电影周边商店 My Favourite Cinema Store 买到的《夜空总有最大密度的蓝色》小卡，我在那家店买到了我这半年最喜欢的杂志 Prism Of</span></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhojT7YgFwjD0s9FPvxDJCPT7hJ6.jpg"><blockquote><p><span>插播02:提到的首尔好吃烤小章鱼店名为：</span><span href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chungmuro+Jjukkumi+Bulgogi/data=!3m1!4b1!4m4!3m3!1s0x357ca2e350e3a1c7:0xe4b7529b8f996105!16s%2Fg%2F1tg5r_m4!20s8Q98HX6R%2BMVP?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTEwMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" data-url="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chungmuro+Jjukkumi+Bulgogi/data=!3m1!4b1!4m4!3m3!1s0x357ca2e350e3a1c7:0xe4b7529b8f996105!16s%2Fg%2F1tg5r_m4!20s8Q98HX6R%2BMVP?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTEwMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"><span>Chungmuro Jjukkumi Bulgogi</span></span></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5f0oHREHJN6vGQhBIl_URn1sII.jpg"><p></p><p><strong><span>* 如果你喜欢这一期，欢迎评论、分享与打赏，每次看到评论区有新留言总是开心的！谢谢支持，谢谢鼓励，谢谢喜欢。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>📬 </span><strong><span>联系我</span></strong></p><p><span>hswconnie@gmail.com</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
