    <title>vol.70 反复听的几期播客：不专业的、认真的、不曾想到的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a8c0d0c8cdeb38c2dde19f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a8c0d0c8cdeb38c2dde19f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 23:43:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期会聊一些我最近跑步时反复听的几个播客，无论是主持人还是嘉宾我都很喜欢，我在这几期播客里获得挺多启发和鼓励的。跑步时听播客和听歌是两种状态，听歌时，会不自觉沉浸到节奏里，跟着节奏去迈左脚和右脚，好像身体会完全占上风；但边跑边听播客时，脑子好像才是更用力的器官，一不小心发现在跑过的 3 公里内，原来已经想了无数件事情。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>* </span></strong><em><strong><span>On昂跑</span></strong></em><strong><span>品牌播客深圳篇正在更新中，也欢迎大家一边跑，一边和 </span></strong><em><strong><span>On昂跑 </span></strong></em><strong><span>一起，发现城市的不同面向。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>🎤 提到的几个播客：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Service 95 / </span><a href="https://service95.com/the-interview-dua-lipa-ocean-vuong" data-url="https://service95.com/the-interview-dua-lipa-ocean-vuong"><span>Dua Talks To Ocean Vuong About On Earth We’re Briefly Gorgeous</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Service 95 / </span><a href="https://service95.com/patti-smith-author-qa" data-url="https://service95.com/patti-smith-author-qa"><span>with Patti Smith</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>The Pink House / </span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/4h0mnxHcdeEcXCMYY4DpGi" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/episode/4h0mnxHcdeEcXCMYY4DpGi"><span>In the Garden with Ocean Vuong</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Time Sensitive / </span><a href="https://timesensitive.fm/episode/faye-toogood-on-creation-as-a-form-of-connection/" data-url="https://timesensitive.fm/episode/faye-toogood-on-creation-as-a-form-of-connection/"><span>Faye Toogood on Creation as a Form of Connection</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Homing (the Modern House) / </span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/3v6nzLQcVM4n08zBNBKCrr" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/episode/3v6nzLQcVM4n08zBNBKCrr"><span>Faye Toogood</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Homing (the Modern House) / </span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0JKN2bCFRWpEaL1aUrjWk2" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0JKN2bCFRWpEaL1aUrjWk2"><span>Margaret Howell</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>* 如果你喜欢这一期，欢迎评论、分享与打赏，每次看到评论区有新留言总是开心的！谢谢支持，谢谢鼓励，谢谢喜欢。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📬 联系我</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>hswconnie@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 片头片尾曲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Beach House - Used To Be</span></p>]]></description>
